{
  "id": "tokstat",
  "name": {
    "default": "AI Token Usage",
    "zh": "AI 用量",
    "ja": "AI トークン使用量"
  },
  "description": {
    "default": "AI coding token usage (session & weekly) in your menu bar — progress bars, reset countdowns. Enable the providers you use; pick which show in the menu bar.",
    "zh": "在菜单栏查看 AI 编程用量（会话与每周），含进度条与重置倒计时。按需启用各家、选择在菜单栏显示哪些。",
    "ja": "メニューバーで AI コーディングの使用量（セッション・週）を表示。使うプロバイダを有効化し、メニューバーに出すものを選べます。"
  },
  "version": "0.3.4",
  "license": "MIT",
  "min_runtime": "0.1.8",
  "renderer": "auto",
  "requires": [
    {
      "plugin": "aicreds",
      "version": ">=0.1.0"
    }
  ],
  "permissions": [
    "data:read",
    "data:write",
    "settings:read",
    "settings:write",
    "notifications:post"
  ],
  "settings": {
    "groups": [
      {
        "title": {
          "default": "Track",
          "zh": "统计",
          "ja": "計測"
        },
        "fields": [
          {
            "key": "enable_claude",
            "type": "bool",
            "default": "true",
            "label": {
              "default": "Claude",
              "zh": "Claude",
              "ja": "Claude"
            },
            "help": {
              "default": "Poll Claude usage",
              "zh": "统计 Claude 用量",
              "ja": "Claude 使用量を計測"
            }
          },
          {
            "key": "enable_codex",
            "type": "bool",
            "default": "true",
            "label": {
              "default": "Codex",
              "zh": "Codex",
              "ja": "Codex"
            },
            "help": {
              "default": "Poll Codex usage",
              "zh": "统计 Codex 用量",
              "ja": "Codex 使用量を計測"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": {
          "default": "Menu bar",
          "zh": "菜单栏",
          "ja": "メニューバー"
        },
        "fields": [
          {
            "key": "menubar_layout",
            "type": "select",
            "default": "horizontal",
            "label": {
              "default": "Layout",
              "zh": "排列",
              "ja": "レイアウト"
            },
            "options": [
              {
                "value": "horizontal",
                "label": {
                  "default": "Horizontal",
                  "zh": "水平",
                  "ja": "横"
                }
              },
              {
                "value": "vertical",
                "label": {
                  "default": "Vertical",
                  "zh": "竖直",
                  "ja": "縦"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "menubar_style",
            "type": "select",
            "default": "bar",
            "label": {
              "default": "Style",
              "zh": "形态",
              "ja": "形式"
            },
            "options": [
              {
                "value": "bar",
                "label": {
                  "default": "Bar",
                  "zh": "进度条",
                  "ja": "バー"
                }
              },
              {
                "value": "text",
                "label": {
                  "default": "Percent",
                  "zh": "百分比",
                  "ja": "パーセント"
                }
              },
              {
                "value": "gauge",
                "label": {
                  "default": "Ring",
                  "zh": "圆环",
                  "ja": "リング"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "primary_color",
            "type": "color",
            "default": "",
            "label": {
              "default": "Primary color",
              "zh": "主颜色",
              "ja": "メインカラー"
            },
            "help": {
              "default": "Empty = system accent; high usage → orange/red",
              "zh": "留空＝系统强调色；高用量→橙/红",
              "ja": "空＝システム強調色、高使用→オレンジ/赤"
            }
          },
          {
            "key": "tray_claude",
            "type": "bool",
            "default": "true",
            "label": {
              "default": "Claude",
              "zh": "Claude",
              "ja": "Claude"
            },
            "help": {
              "default": "Show in menu bar",
              "zh": "在菜单栏显示",
              "ja": "メニューバーに表示"
            },
            "disabledWhen": {
              "key": "enable_claude",
              "equals": "false"
            }
          },
          {
            "key": "tray_codex",
            "type": "bool",
            "default": "true",
            "label": {
              "default": "Codex",
              "zh": "Codex",
              "ja": "Codex"
            },
            "help": {
              "default": "Show in menu bar",
              "zh": "在菜单栏显示",
              "ja": "メニューバーに表示"
            },
            "disabledWhen": {
              "key": "enable_codex",
              "equals": "false"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": {
          "default": "Alerts",
          "zh": "提醒",
          "ja": "通知"
        },
        "fields": [
          {
            "key": "notify_enabled",
            "type": "bool",
            "default": "true",
            "label": {
              "default": "Usage alerts",
              "zh": "用量提醒",
              "ja": "使用量アラート"
            },
            "help": {
              "default": "Notify at threshold",
              "zh": "达阈值时通知",
              "ja": "しきい値で通知"
            }
          },
          {
            "key": "notify_at",
            "type": "slider",
            "default": "90",
            "min": 50,
            "max": 100,
            "step": 5,
            "label": {
              "default": "Threshold %",
              "zh": "阈值 %",
              "ja": "しきい値 %"
            },
            "help": {
              "default": "Session or weekly reaches this %",
              "zh": "会话或每周达此 %",
              "ja": "セッション/週がこの%"
            },
            "disabledWhen": {
              "key": "notify_enabled",
              "equals": "false"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "collections": {
    "samples": {
      "storage": "persistent",
      "schema": {
        "ts": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "source": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "ok": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "session_pct": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "weekly_pct": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "session_resets_ms": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "weekly_resets_ms": {
          "type": "integer"
        }
      }
    },
    "current": {
      "storage": "persistent",
      "schema": {
        "source": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "label": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "abbrev": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "order": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "enabled": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "ts": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "refreshed_text": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "ok": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "needs_auth": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "notified_session": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "notified_weekly": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "err": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "session_pct": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "session_pct_text": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "session_color": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "session_reset_text": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "weekly_pct": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "weekly_pct_text": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "weekly_color": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "weekly_reset_text": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "jobs": [
    {
      "id": "refresh",
      "run": "refresh",
      "every": 300000,
      "while": "always"
    }
  ],
  "comment_state": "DATA_FLOW.md：refresh job(每 5min + 开窗即刷/切设置即刷)对每个已启用 provider 读凭据(aicreds)→ app 内 HTTP 拉用量 → upsert `current`(每 provider 一行,by_field source,含 enabled 标志) + append `samples`。`current` 是**持久缓存**:禁用只标 enabled=false(不删,保值);429/需登录 → 保留上次真值,current 缺失但有 sample → 从最新 sample 重建。弹层 <DataList collection=current where enabled=true orderBy order> 数据驱动渲染;菜单栏 TrayLabel 用 <Image logo>+<Progress bar> 读 `current`,可见性靠 ui.tsx 守卫 `enable_X && tray_X`(op:if),方向靠 `menubar_layout` 设置。settings 两组:统计(enable_X 总开关)/ 菜单栏(menubar_layout + tray_X,tray_X disabledWhen enable_X=false 置灰)。加新 provider(gemini…)=改 scripts PROVIDERS + aicreds + settings 两组各加开关 + ui.tsx 加一组 logo/bar 与弹层块。不用 setState 表征(全走 SQLite,walker 可读)。",
  "state": {},
  "window": {
    "width": 280,
    "height": 340
  },
  "icon": {
    "fg": "coins-fill",
    "bg": "#7c3aed"
  },
  "shots": {
    "seed": "tokstat.shots.seed.json",
    "locales": [
      "en",
      "zh"
    ],
    "themes": [
      "dark",
      "light"
    ],
    "frames": [
      {
        "id": "main",
        "caption": {
          "default": "Every AI plan’s usage, at a glance",
          "zh": "所有 AI 用量,一眼看尽"
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
